.DS_Store
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log

**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.vite/
**/*.tsbuildinfo
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Local agent/editor state and Sites deployment bindings are machine-specific.
.serena/
**/.openai/hosting.json

# The viral replication workbench is a reviewed public static release surface.
!sites/viral-replication-workbench/dist/
!sites/viral-replication-workbench/dist/**

*.db
*.sqlite3
postgres-data/
redis-data/

work/
outputs/*
!outputs/oumomo-reverse-engineering/
!outputs/oumomo-reverse-engineering/**

# Local commercial/evidence data may be ignored but is not disposable. Never
# use a broad ignored-file clean against outputs/; inspect manifests, hashes,
# provenance and backup status first.

# Clean-room evidence may retain local generated media for analysis, but raw
# inputs/outputs are never repository artifacts. Commit only hashes, manifests
# and written findings from this subtree.
outputs/oumomo-reverse-engineering/artifacts/*
!outputs/oumomo-reverse-engineering/artifacts/hashes.csv
!outputs/oumomo-reverse-engineering/artifacts/scorecards.csv
outputs/oumomo-reverse-engineering/fixtures/scoring-degradations/

# Understand-Anything: version the final graph and metadata, not scratch data.
.ua/intermediate/
.ua/tmp/
.ua/.trash-*/
